### 회원가입
POST http://localhost:8080/auth/signup
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "test@test.com",
  "password": "1234",
  "nickname": "홍길동"
}

### 로그인 → 토큰 복사
POST http://localhost:8080/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "test@test.com",
  "password": "1234"
}

### 게시글 작성 (토큰 필요)
POST http://localhost:8080/trade-posts
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9.eyJzdWIiOiJ0ZXN0QHRlc3QuY29tIiwicm9sZSI6IlVTRVIiLCJpYXQiOjE3NzQyNTUwOTEsImV4cCI6MTc3NDM0MTQ5MX0.Yqu00cQH6cehsaV320rGY2pG4rfVhUFBwbzVUh84dkI
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "아이폰 15 팔아요",
  "description": "3개월 사용, 케이스 포함",
  "price": 900000,
  "category": "ELECTRONICS",
  "imageUrl": "https://example.com/img.jpg"
}

### 목록 조회 (비로그인 가능)
GET http://localhost:8080/trade-posts?page=0&size=10

### 카테고리 필터 조회
GET http://localhost:8080/trade-posts?category=ELECTRONICS&page=0&size=10

### 키워드 검색
GET http://localhost:8080/trade-posts?keyword=아이폰&page=0&size=10

### 단건 조회
GET http://localhost:8080/trade-posts/2

### 상태 변경 (예약중으로)
PATCH http://localhost:8080/trade-posts/2/status?status=RESERVED
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9.eyJzdWIiOiJ0ZXN0QHRlc3QuY29tIiwicm9sZSI6IlVTRVIiLCJpYXQiOjE3NzQyNTUwOTEsImV4cCI6MTc3NDM0MTQ5MX0.Yqu00cQH6cehsaV320rGY2pG4rfVhUFBwbzVUh84dkI

